      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} It's never been water tight, but it didn't leak it like this. Before you kinda had to intentionally look to find someone who was blocking you. This just puts it right their profile image right there. If someone that you blocked is in the same instance as you, it doesn't show them (unless you ALSO blocked them)\n\nSo just showing you that they're in an instance which you're not in is a bit too leaky IMO.",
